---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Chapter 3: Totalitarian Control and Collapse">
	<main class="space-y-12 animate-in fade-in slide-in-from-bottom-8 duration-700 mt-8 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 pb-24">
		<a href="/modules" class="inline-flex items-center text-sm font-medium text-slate-400 hover:text-cyan-400 transition-colors">
			<span aria-hidden="true" class="mr-2">←</span> Back to Modules
		</a>

		<div class="space-y-4">
			<span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-slate-950 border border-white/10 text-cyan-400 text-xs font-bold tracking-widest shadow-inner">
				CHAPTER 3
			</span>
			<h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white">
				Totalitarian Control and Collapse
			</h1>
		</div>

		<div class="prose prose-invert prose-slate prose-cyan lg:prose-xl max-w-none">
			<div class="space-y-6">
				<div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/50 border border-white/5">
					<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Phase 6: Dictatorship | Decay</h3>
					<p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed font-light m-0">The system starts breaking down, and elites enforce extreme, heavy-handed rules to force compliance and stay in power.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/50 border border-white/5">
					<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Phase 7: Collapse and Emergence</h3>
					<p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed font-light m-0">The old system completely falls apart, resetting the baseline so a brand-new cycle can eventually emerge.</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</main>
</Layout>
